    "title": "Parking Lot: State Police arrest suspect in deadly shooting at Ohkay Owingeh Casino - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Following the shooting, Trujillo removed Tiberi from his vehicle and fled the scene in a red Ford Mustang. Rio Arriba County, N.M. — On November 15, 2025, at approximately 12:26 a.m., Rio Arriba County Sheriff’s deputies responded to a report of a male gunshot victim located in the parking lot of the Ohkay Owingeh Casino. New Mexico State Police (NMSP) officers responded to assist, and the investigation was subsequently assumed by the NMSP Investigations Bureau. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
